Interrupt IDs change on every run, so match on the action request's tool name when choosing a decision, then key the resume map by interrupt ID when you send a @[`Command`]. Refer to the [human-in-the-loop guide](/oss/langchain/human-in-the-loop) for additional details. For demonstration purposes, here we will accept the calendar event, but edit the subject of the outbound email:

